{"id": "EUVD-2026-80437", "enisaUuid": "b2474bf1-ec0e-351d-a43c-eca52424229c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nf2fs: fix dentry folio leak in find_in_level\n\nfind_in_level() gets a dentry folio with f2fs_find_data_folio() before\ncalling find_in_block().  If find_in_block() returns an error, the\nfunction stores the error in res_folio and breaks out of the loop without\ndropping the dentry folio.\n\nThis leaks the folio reference on the find_in_block() error path.  Drop\nthe dentry folio before returning the error to the caller.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:31:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:49:00", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b6c0e77d950bf80ab357e2b4b9667f4389ed417c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/af9cc316d31371824de8d409260a2ab9759dd51c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aefb4b0f465b6f95fe02b52d1822a3fb4a9ae922", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93a3e6a4c9e726a13a935963e8dc43d181db1527", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cca7d3e30bf30333314e31bc70b9a739f1342167"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cwf6-7jp2-62cf", "CVE-2026-89837"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "315fce6f-7fec-3fbc-a40a-1ebd496bee68", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "490770ed-a2b9-3ea8-87e7-080d6d74718c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ad08a58bf67594057362e45cbddd3e27e53e557 <af9cc316d31371824de8d409260a2ab9759dd51c"}, {"id": "519c954c-72a5-39da-afe5-843bb25a7815", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ad08a58bf67594057362e45cbddd3e27e53e557 <aefb4b0f465b6f95fe02b52d1822a3fb4a9ae922"}, {"id": "5868dcbc-3348-3294-b297-8db6a0e8c339", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "58d80f7f-7988-39f3-90e8-984a3f968bc8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "8bc628aa-bf1d-32db-9796-e32d4348a17d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.11"}, {"id": "af553c58-9b9d-34e7-a095-13fd47880476", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "b4b060f3-823f-3e88-b878-8442f3283990", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ad08a58bf67594057362e45cbddd3e27e53e557 <b6c0e77d950bf80ab357e2b4b9667f4389ed417c"}, {"id": "c03d1e85-b5a8-395a-a8b4-1c2f2c717cf5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "d30bb4b9-61a1-3c41-b971-723f203b4232", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "d582cd10-9cf3-39f8-874c-fb9feb6a3a85", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ad08a58bf67594057362e45cbddd3e27e53e557 <93a3e6a4c9e726a13a935963e8dc43d181db1527"}, {"id": "e897c18e-d3eb-3d53-9dc2-1f3d63c0f4c0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ad08a58bf67594057362e45cbddd3e27e53e557 <cca7d3e30bf30333314e31bc70b9a739f1342167"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0c5a5d86-6b67-3d4f-a255-84f68a010f75", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}